   ## Disclaimer

Exocortex is experimental software provided for research and personal knowledge exploration on an "AS IS" basis. It performs direct file system I/O within the configured Obsidian vault. Always maintain independent backups of your notes and data. LLM-generated responses should not be treated as professional, legal, or medical advice.
